 "nl": [
  "No packet from dns-servers may enter iot-sensors, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Deny all traffic from research to hr (this overrides any public service).",
  "dns-servers must accept SMTP (TCP 25) and HTTPS (TCP 443) and NTP (UDP 123) from dmz-web.",
  "hr must accept LDAP (TCP 389) and syslog (UDP 514) from dns-servers.",
  "guest-wifi is isolated: it may only reach iot-sensors on DNS over UDP 53; research on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in library may reach backup over SMTP (TCP 25) and SMB (TCP 445) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "engineering must never reach dmz-web, regardless of any other rule."
 ],
